# Forbidden runtime-provider identities for
# scripts/check/check-linux-hosted-wm-live-window-evidence.shs.
#
# Every row records the SHA-256 content digest of a known Rust-seed/bootstrap
# libsimple_runtime.so build. The hosted WM live-window evidence check refuses
# any runtime provider whose content digest matches a row, even when the
# canonical bootstrap artifact (src/compiler_rust/target/bootstrap/deps/
# libsimple_runtime.so) is absent from the checkout, so a bootstrap DSO copied
# from elsewhere cannot be admitted with a caller-supplied matching hash.
#
# Seeds below were recorded 2026-11-05 from the aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu
# Rust-cargo bootstrap build trees under .simple/storage/build/bootstrap/.
# Append new rows when a new bootstrap runtime build appears; never remove a
# row (forbidden identities are cumulative).
